        "Description": "Agent 47 has been kidnapped, and brought to Sapienza! Unfortunatly, the people who did kidnap him are clever, and learned he likes to use disguises, so they put tracking devices in everyone&apos;s clothing. Another unofrtunate peice of news, 4 people here have devices that will kill 47 if he leaves. Dispose of them. \r\r(Thanks for checking this out! For the best experience, please start at the Sapienza Ruins, and please don&apos;t bring anything. Thanks!)",
